Design Rules:
- Core Architecture: Actor Model (Zero shared memory).

Building Rules:
- DO NOT use cmake reconfiguration if the cmake files not changed.
- Use Ninja as generator.
- Generate `compile_commands.json` database file during CMake config phase by default.

Implementation & Coding Rules:
- Programming Language：C++20
- Coding Style: Strictly adhere to the LLVM Coding Standards.
- Performance Constraints: Avoid RTTI, disable Exceptions, and prioritize stack allocation.
- Memory Safety: All tests must pass AddressSanitizer (ASan).
